Cell["\<\
Testing p-value by randomization (all 10,000 had slopes of lower magnitude):\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.956745491433476*^9, 
  3.956745509171114*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2537e611-8e3c-48e8-85a1-\
